  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "AssetsExplorerComponent acts as the primary UI controller for managing digital assets within the editor. It orchestrates asset browsing, selection, and manipulation by coordinating state changes via EditorStateService. It handles user interactions like context menu activation and asset creation, delegating persistence and loading tasks to AssetService and AssetsExplorerService. Its core function is synchronizing the UI view with the application's project state."
  },
